{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-线索、表单与互动\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"获取营销账号下的所有评论列表，可根据多种条件进行筛选和排序，如时间、点赞数、评论等级等。可配合【获取Access token】和【获取抖音授权关系】接口使用。\",\"id\":\"marketing.comment.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/tools/comment/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"1754803808580608\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"auth.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"douyin.authorization.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1729983667746823\",\"reason\":\"可通过此接口获取item_id和视频相关信息用于筛选评论\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取抖音授权关系\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"1754803808580608\",\"title\":\"获取评论列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-J0Agj2Ya\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-au19Kkad\">获取营销账号下的所有评论列表</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-cBwi2sED\"><br/></p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201750796585425935%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-kyDJCv3u\" id=\"h346b9f0-kyDJCv3u\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-6P2UC0wr\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/comment/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/comment/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1754803808580608\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-c2o18BS1\" id=\"h346b9f0-c2o18BS1\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-ow1HrtSZ\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-GDaZq1OV\" id=\"h346b9f0-GDaZq1OV\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dKylzzCB\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-DFgroYwI\" id=\"h346b9f0-DFgroYwI\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wpPH3fbf\">客户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RTkJ7PXi\">查询起始时间，格式：yyyy-MM-dd，时间跨度最大三个月，仅支持获取2021-01-01之后的评论</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-T9tclGfr\">查询截止时间，格式：yyyy-MM-dd，时间跨度最大三个月，仅支持获取2021-01-01之后的评论</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_field</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rVCyuHfX\">排序字段，允许值：\n </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-203Uns2q\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-F7pZZS42\"><code>CREATE_TIME</code> 按评论时间排序（默认值）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8Rhap5xi\"><code>LIKE_COUNT</code> 按点赞数量排序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UxhDJCoU\"><code>REPLY_COUNT</code> 按评论回复数量排序</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PIxs7hoV\">排序类型，允许值：\n </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-EOs7UveY\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Vmxokvsd\"><code>ASC</code> 顺序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0UK0CSBq\"><code>DESC</code> 倒序（默认值）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-InjifJOC\">过滤条件，若此字段不传，或传空则视为无限制条件</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">ad_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FgCWhwqn\">计划id列表，一次最多100个</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">item_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OajmCqxU\">营销视频id列表，一次最多100个，可通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1729983667746823\" target=\"_blank\">获取抖音授权关系</a>】获取item_id和视频相关信息</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">level_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dtgFmJoX\">查询的评论等级，允许值： </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Jtb4FXHD\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TJEJk6eJ\"><code>LEVEL_ALL</code> 所有等级</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FX4KPami\"><code>LEVEL_ONE</code> 一级评论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-oCCJxiPj\"><code>LEVEL_TWO</code> 二级评论</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">is_replied</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LmwCNgbN\">是否已回复</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">hide_status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wDhHLiLj\">隐藏状态， 允许值： </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-WzUkk5gU\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KzHfPAdB\"><code>ALL</code> 全部</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KIFoXnN2\"><code>HIDE</code> 已隐藏</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aPfGyVbI\"><code>NOT_HIDE</code> 未隐藏（默认值）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">emotion_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mqyEFGs1\">评论情感，允许值： </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-J2GneaFA\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QaQ0yWXF\"><code>NEGATIVE</code> 负向评论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-77Us9WZN\"><code>NEUTRAL</code> 中性评论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7IlkZMOe\"><code>POSITIVE</code> 正向评论</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">content</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OxgaqY3i\">评论关键词，最长支持10个字符</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">author_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oidtIcch\">视频作者抖音id，最多支持100个</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">comment_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-orOy3GF6\">评论内容类型，允许值： </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-8oSSwxrC\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-oV5wfJzn\"><code>IMAGE_COMMENT</code> 图片评论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-sEAgPai3\"><code>IMAGE_TEXT_COMMENT</code> 图文评论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XNy71STP\"><code>TEXT_COMMENT</code> 文字评论</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AhEA1WLn\">页码，默认值: 1</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p8